# Biến runtime dùng chung cho mọi process (ecosystem.config.cjs nạp)
# Copy thành .env.runtime rồi điền giá trị. KHÔNG commit file thật.
AM_COORD_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8780
AM_TURNS_LOG=/root/lucy/agent-machine/.turns
CLAUDE_EFFORT=high
IS_SANDBOX=1
LUCY_HUB_HOST=127.0.0.1
LUCY_HUB_PASSWORD=
LUCY_HUB_PORT=8800
LUCY_PERSONA_CHAT=1
LUCY_PROJECTS_ROOT=/root/lucy
LUCY_PROMPT_ARCHITECT=1
LUCY_SKILL_LEARN=1
LUCY_STATE=/root/.lucy-hub
LUCY_TZ_OFFSET=7
LUCY_VAULT=/root/lucy/lucy-vault
